{"id":"eeb38ec76a8b0062","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/256_Russell_类型集合论.md","title":"256 Russell 类型集合论","display":"256_Russell_类型集合论","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-分支类型与符号表\">1. 分支类型与符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。本篇选取具有外延与预测性理解的一元分支句法系统。类型保留完整参数类型，不能仅凭简单深度和最高级次判同。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RType}\">\\(\\mathsf{RType}\\)</span> 是有限带标签类型树的最小集合，形成子句为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=\\operatorname{ind}\\in\\mathsf{RType}\">\\(\\iota=\\operatorname{ind}\\in\\mathsf{RType}\\)</span>，并置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o(\\iota)=0\">\\(o(\\iota)=0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&gt;o(\\tau)\">\\(r&gt;o(\\tau)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)\\in\\mathsf{RType}\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)\\in\\mathsf{RType}\\)</span>，并置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r))=r\">\\(o(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r))=r\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>类型相等为带标签树的字面相等；两个构造子互不相交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}\\)</span> 在两个参数上单射。每个非个体型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)\\)</span> 的参数型恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>。不额外加入无参数命题型或多元谓词型。</p>\n<p>定义投影与分支：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SType}_{RTT}=\\mathbb N,\\qquad d,o:\\mathsf{RType}\\to\\mathbb N,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SType}_{RTT}=\\mathbb N,\\qquad d,o:\\mathsf{RType}\\to\\mathbb N,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d(\\iota)=0,\\qquad d(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r))=d(\\tau)+1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d(\\iota)=0,\\qquad d(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r))=d(\\tau)+1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Branch}_{RTT}\n=\\{(\\tau,\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r&gt;o(\\tau)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Branch}_{RTT}\n=\\{(\\tau,\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r&gt;o(\\tau)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一般关系类型的外部记号边界为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RelType}_{RTT}\n=\\{((\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_m);r):m\\ge1,\\ \\tau_i\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r&gt;\\max_{1\\le i\\le m}o(\\tau_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RelType}_{RTT}\n=\\{((\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_m);r):m\\ge1,\\ \\tau_i\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r&gt;\\max_{1\\le i\\le m}o(\\tau_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>此集合只记录描述子；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=1\">\\(m=1\\)</span> 的描述子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\tau);r)\">\\(((\\tau);r)\\)</span> 对应本语言的类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)\\)</span>。对每个合法型定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}=\\{v_i^\\tau:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{RTT}=\\bigcup_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}}\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}=\\{v_i^\\tau:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{RTT}=\\bigcup_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}}\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>各变量集以完整类型树为标签且两两不交。对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{RTT}(\\tau,X)=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i^\\tau\\notin X\\}}^\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{RTT}(\\tau,X)=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i^\\tau\\notin X\\}}^\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{var}_\\tau\\)</span>；公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}_\\tau,\\operatorname{mem}_{\\tau,r},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}_\\tau,\\operatorname{mem}_{\\tau,r},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}_\\tau\\)</span>。其型在下一节给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT}=\\bigcup_\\tau\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT}=\\bigcup_\\tau\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span>。变量名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span> 在项位置严格显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x)\\)</span>；量词与 fresh 的变量槽仍取变量名。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 是满足以下五个形成子句的最小带标签树集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}_\\tau(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}_\\tau(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq_\\tau t\">\\(s\\doteq_\\tau t\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}^{RTT}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}^{RTT}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&gt;o(\\tau)\">\\(r&gt;o(\\tau)\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mem}_{\\tau,r}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{mem}_{\\tau,r}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in_{\\tau,r}t\">\\(s\\in_{\\tau,r}t\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)\">\\((A\\to B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}_\\tau(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}_\\tau(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_\\tau x\\,A\">\\(\\forall_\\tau x\\,A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\vee B:=(\\neg A\\to B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\vee B:=(\\neg A\\to B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists_\\tau x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall_\\tau x\\,\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists_\\tau x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall_\\tau x\\,\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个量词体由紧随其后的括号或作为单一公式参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 明示；公理中量词块作为蕴含的操作数时均加整体括号。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-名字与结构操作\">3. 名字与结构操作</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathsf{Var}_{RTT}\">\\(V=\\mathsf{Var}_{RTT}\\)</span>。自由和绑定变量函数的型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T,BV_T:\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT}\\to\\mathcal P_{fin}(V),\\qquad\nFV,BV:\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\to\\mathcal P_{fin}(V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T,BV_T:\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT}\\to\\mathcal P_{fin}(V),\\qquad\nFV,BV:\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\to\\mathcal P_{fin}(V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x))=\\{x\\},\\qquad BV_T(\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x))=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x))=\\{x\\},\\qquad BV_T(\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(x))=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>两个原子分别满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(s\\doteq_\\tau t)=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\qquad BV(s\\doteq_\\tau t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(s\\doteq_\\tau t)=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\qquad BV(s\\doteq_\\tau t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(s\\in_{\\tau,r}t)=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\qquad BV(s\\in_{\\tau,r}t)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(s\\in_{\\tau,r}t)=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\qquad BV(s\\in_{\\tau,r}t)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>三个逻辑构造子满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\neg A)=FV(A),\\quad BV(\\neg A)=BV(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\neg A)=FV(A),\\quad BV(\\neg A)=BV(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(A\\to B)=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\\quad BV(A\\to B)=BV(A)\\cup BV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(A\\to B)=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\\quad BV(A\\to B)=BV(A)\\cup BV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\forall_\\tau x A)=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\nBV(\\forall_\\tau x A)=BV(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\forall_\\tau x A)=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\nBV(\\forall_\\tau x A)=BV(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}FV(A)\">\\(FV(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}FV(A)\\)</span>。假设集合按集合相等比较，原始语法树按字面相等比较。</p>\n<p>项替换的型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T:\\bigcup_{\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}}\n(\\mathsf{Term}_\\sigma^{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT})\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T:\\bigcup_{\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}}\n(\\mathsf{Term}_\\sigma^{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT})\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_\\sigma(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}s,&amp;y=x,\\\\ \\operatorname{var}_\\sigma(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}_\\sigma(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}s,&amp;y=x,\\\\ \\operatorname{var}_\\sigma(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命中时变量标签已强制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\tau\">\\(\\sigma=\\tau\\)</span>，故结果始终保留源项类型。公式替换的型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F:\\bigcup_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}}\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT})\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F:\\bigcup_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}}\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT})\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T(t,x,s)=t[x:=s]\">\\(Sub_T(t,x,s)=t[x:=s]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F(A,x,s)=A[x:=s]\">\\(Sub_F(A,x,s)=A[x:=s]\\)</span>。五头递归为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq_\\sigma v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\doteq_\\sigma v[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq_\\sigma v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\doteq_\\sigma v[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\in_{\\sigma,r}v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\in_{\\sigma,r}v[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\in_{\\sigma,r}v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\in_{\\sigma,r}v[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\qquad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\qquad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall_\\sigma y A\">\\(C=\\forall_\\sigma y A\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall_\\sigma y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\n\\forall_\\sigma z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}_\\sigma(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall_\\sigma y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\n\\forall_\\sigma z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}_\\sigma(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{RTT}(\\sigma,(FV(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_\\sigma^{RTT}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{RTT}(\\sigma,(FV(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_\\sigma^{RTT}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不同类型的 binder 不能与替换项名字冲突；同类型冲突时上述第三分支改绑。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FreeRen(A,x,y)=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(y)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FreeRen(A,x,y)=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(y)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall_\\tau x A\">\\(C=\\forall_\\tau x A\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\setminus FV(A)\">\\(y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\setminus FV(A)\\)</span>，定义偏函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BoundRen(C,x,y)=\\forall_\\tau y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(y)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BoundRen(C,x,y)=\\forall_\\tau y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_\\tau(y)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 上满足下列条件的所有等价关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,E\\,B\\Rightarrow\\neg A\\,E\\,\\neg B\">\\(A\\,E\\,B\\Rightarrow\\neg A\\,E\\,\\neg B\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\\,E\\,B_0\">\\(A_0\\,E\\,B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_1\\,E\\,B_1\\Rightarrow(A_0\\to A_1)\\,E\\,(B_0\\to B_1)\">\\(A_1\\,E\\,B_1\\Rightarrow(A_0\\to A_1)\\,E\\,(B_0\\to B_1)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,E\\,B\">\\(A\\,E\\,B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\Rightarrow(\\forall_\\tau x A)\\,E\\,(\\forall_\\tau x B)\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\Rightarrow(\\forall_\\tau x A)\\,E\\,(\\forall_\\tau x B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>每个合法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BoundRen(C,x,y)\">\\(BoundRen(C,x,y)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\,E\\,BoundRen(C,x,y)\">\\(C\\,E\\,BoundRen(C,x,y)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原子项参数按字面保持，没有跨类型的 alpha 识别。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公式级次与预测性条件\">4. 公式级次与预测性条件</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ord:\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ord:\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"ord(s\\doteq_\\tau t)=0,\\qquad ord(s\\in_{\\tau,r}t)=r,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[ord(s\\doteq_\\tau t)=0,\\qquad ord(s\\in_{\\tau,r}t)=r,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"ord(\\neg A)=ord(A),\\qquad ord(A\\to B)=\\max(ord(A),ord(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[ord(\\neg A)=ord(A),\\qquad ord(A\\to B)=\\max(ord(A),ord(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"ord(\\forall_\\tau x A)=\\max(o(\\tau)+1,ord(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[ord(\\forall_\\tau x A)=\\max(o(\\tau)+1,ord(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这是本篇保留的公式级次政策。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PredCompOK(A,\\tau,r,x,y)\">\\(PredCompOK(A,\\tau,r,x,y)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\\quad\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\quad r\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad r&gt;o(\\tau),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\\quad\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\quad r\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad r&gt;o(\\tau),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\quad y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}^{RTT},\\quad\nord(A)&lt;r,\\quad y\\notin FV(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\quad y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}^{RTT},\\quad\nord(A)&lt;r,\\quad y\\notin FV(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>本地七个逻辑公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_K=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_K=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_S=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_S=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{Cl}=\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{Cl}=\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall E}=\\{(\\forall_\\tau x A)\\to A[x:=t]:\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall E}=\\{(\\forall_\\tau x A)\\to A[x:=t]:\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall D}=\\{(\\forall_\\tau x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall_\\tau x B):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\\ x\\notin FV(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall D}=\\{(\\forall_\\tau x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall_\\tau x B):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\\ x\\notin FV(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{EqR}=\\{t\\doteq_\\tau t:\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{EqR}=\\{t\\doteq_\\tau t:\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{EqSub}=\\{(t\\doteq_\\tau u)\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ t,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{EqSub}=\\{(t\\doteq_\\tau u)\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ t,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{Log}=Ax_K\\cup Ax_S\\cup Ax_{Cl}\\cup Ax_{\\forall E}\\cup Ax_{\\forall D}\\cup Ax_{EqR}\\cup Ax_{EqSub}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{Log}=Ax_K\\cup Ax_S\\cup Ax_{Cl}\\cup Ax_{\\forall E}\\cup Ax_{\\forall D}\\cup Ax_{EqR}\\cup Ax_{EqSub}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>外延与理解公理分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{Ext}=\\{(\\forall_\\tau z(z\\in_{\\tau,r}x\\leftrightarrow z\\in_{\\tau,r}y))\\to\nx\\doteq_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}y:\n\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ r&gt;o(\\tau),\\ x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}^{RTT},\\ z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{Ext}=\\{(\\forall_\\tau z(z\\in_{\\tau,r}x\\leftrightarrow z\\in_{\\tau,r}y))\\to\nx\\doteq_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}y:\n\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ r&gt;o(\\tau),\\ x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}^{RTT},\\ z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{PredComp}=\\{\\exists_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}y\\,\\forall_\\tau x\n(x\\in_{\\tau,r}y\\leftrightarrow A):PredCompOK(A,\\tau,r,x,y)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{PredComp}=\\{\\exists_{\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)}y\\,\\forall_\\tau x\n(x\\in_{\\tau,r}y\\leftrightarrow A):PredCompOK(A,\\tau,r,x,y)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{RTT}=Ax_{Log}\\cup Ax_{Ext}\\cup Ax_{PredComp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{RTT}=Ax_{Log}\\cup Ax_{Ext}\\cup Ax_{PredComp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-规则、证明与可导性\">6. 规则、证明与可导性</h1>\n<p>三条显示规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall_\\tau x A},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall_\\tau x A},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相应类型关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{MP}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{MP}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Gen}=\\{((A),\\forall_\\tau x A):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Gen}=\\{((A),\\forall_\\tau x A):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>三者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span> 的子关系；在假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 下使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Gen}\">\\(Rule_{Gen}\\)</span> 必须有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin FV(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin FV(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Proof_{RTT}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(Proof_{RTT}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in Ax_{RTT}\">\\(A_i\\in Ax_{RTT}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_{MP}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_{MP}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall_\\tau x A_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall_\\tau x A_j\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin FV(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin FV(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_\\alpha A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_\\alpha A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\exists\\pi\\,Proof_{RTT}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A),\\qquad\nThm_{RTT}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{RTT}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{RTT}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\exists\\pi\\,Proof_{RTT}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A),\\qquad\nThm_{RTT}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{RTT}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-版本边界与整个形式系统\">7. 版本边界与整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>类型形成采用 <a href=\"https://www.macs.hw.ac.uk/~fairouz/forest/papers/journals-publications/bsl02/bsl02.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kamareddine–Laan–Nederpelt，Definition 34</a> 的一元限制。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 是投影；它们不取代类型树身份。由两形成子句归纳，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o(\\tau)\\ge d(\\tau)\">\\(o(\\tau)\\ge d(\\tau)\\)</span>，所以没有深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>、级次为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的合法型。外部多元描述子没有产生对象语言的额外排序。本篇保留上述 Hilbert 公理及公式级次政策，不声称与完整 Principia 体系等价。</p>\n<p>最终系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{RTT}=\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{RType},\\mathsf{SType}_{RTT},d,o,\\mathsf{Branch}_{RTT},\\mathsf{RelType}_{RTT},\n(\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT})_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}},\\mathsf{Var}_{RTT},\n(\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT})_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}},\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT},\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\nFV_T,BV_T,FV,BV,Sub_T,Sub_F,FreeRen,BoundRen,\\equiv_\\alpha,\nord,PredCompOK,Ax_{RTT},Rule_{MP},Rule_{Gen},Rule_\\alpha,Proof_{RTT},\\vdash_{RTT},Thm_{RTT}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{RTT}=\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{RType},\\mathsf{SType}_{RTT},d,o,\\mathsf{Branch}_{RTT},\\mathsf{RelType}_{RTT},\n(\\mathsf{Var}_\\tau^{RTT})_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}},\\mathsf{Var}_{RTT},\n(\\mathsf{Term}_\\tau^{RTT})_{\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}},\\mathsf{Term}_{RTT},\\mathsf{Frm}_{RTT},\nFV_T,BV_T,FV,BV,Sub_T,Sub_F,FreeRen,BoundRen,\\equiv_\\alpha,\nord,PredCompOK,Ax_{RTT},Rule_{MP},Rule_{Gen},Rule_\\alpha,Proof_{RTT},\\vdash_{RTT},Thm_{RTT}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含一元分支类型、公式级次、预测性理解、句法操作、公理和有限证明关系；不含可约性公理、无类型成员、一般多元理解、解释结构、语义满足、模型类或可靠性与完备性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-分支类型与符号表","text":"1. 分支类型与符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-名字与结构操作","text":"3. 名字与结构操作","level":1},{"id":"4.-公式级次与预测性条件","text":"4. 公式级次与预测性条件","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-规则、证明与可导性","text":"6. 规则、证明与可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-版本边界与整个形式系统","text":"7. 版本边界与整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota=\\operatorname{ind}\\in\\mathsf{RType}","display":false},{"tex":"o(\\iota)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"r>o(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)\\in\\mathsf{RType}","display":false},{"tex":"o(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r))=r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SType}_{RTT}=\\mathbb N,\\qquad d,o:\\mathsf{RType}\\to\\mathbb N,","display":true},{"tex":"d(\\iota)=0,\\qquad d(\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r))=d(\\tau)+1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Branch}_{RTT}\n=\\{(\\tau,\\operatorname{pred}(\\tau,r)):\\tau\\in\\mathsf{RType},\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ r>o(\\tau)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{R